  "headline": "Aprepitant is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a plant classified OAI 339 days before today",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E5", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows aprepitant is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our three sites' 80 mg capsule stock shares NDC 51407070202 and labeler Golden State Medical Supply, Inc.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That label names Pharmathen International S. A. (FEI 3009961173) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA classified that plant OAI on 2025-11-21, which was 339 days before today.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA also issued a Warning Letter to the plant on 2026-05-27 and an import alert on 2026-04-23.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked move is to transfer 47 capsules of 80 mg from Corvale General to Corvale East, raising East to 14 days on hand while General stays above two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A secondary option is to transfer 3 capsules from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would bring East to 9 days.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
